        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We are also advancing ATI-052, a novel bispecific antibody that simultaneously targets both TSLP and interleukin-4 receptor (“IL-4Ra”), which blocks signaling of both IL-4 and IL-13, potentially offering enhanced efficacy through dual pathway inhibition.",
